      "blocks": {
        "t-1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Cesar's Coffee Cup is built on generations of coffee-growing tradition in Colombia. We source direct from origin and roast to order at our facility in North Williamstown, Melbourne — traceable, seasonal coffee, in your hands within days.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": ["t-1"]
    },
    "story": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "settings": {
        "height": "adapt",
        "desktop_image_width": "medium",
        "layout": "image_first",
        "image_behavior": "none",
        "content_layout": "no-overlap",
        "desktop_content_position": "middle",
        "desktop_content_alignment": "left",
        "mobile_content_alignment": "left",
        "section_color_scheme": "scheme-1",
        "color_scheme": "scheme-1",
        "padding_top": 36,
        "padding_bottom": 36,
        "full_bleed": false
      },
      "blocks": {
        "heading": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Our Story",
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>The business was started on a simple idea: quality coffee shouldn't be reserved for the well-capitalised. Our roots run through direct relationships with growers — including farms we work with directly — across Colombia, Panama, Brazil and Ethiopia. Every lot is traceable back to the producer behind it.</p>",
            "text_style": "body"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": ["heading", "text"]
    },
    "roastery": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "settings": {
        "height": "adapt",
        "desktop_image_width": "medium",
        "layout": "text_first",
        "image_behavior": "none",
        "content_layout": "no-overlap",
        "desktop_content_position": "middle",
        "desktop_content_alignment": "left",
        "mobile_content_alignment": "left",
        "section_color_scheme": "scheme-1",
        "color_scheme": "scheme-1",
        "padding_top": 36,
        "padding_bottom": 36,
        "full_bleed": false
      },
      "blocks": {
        "heading": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "The roastery",
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We roast on Loring S7 Nighthawk and S15 Falcon roasters, with an IMF smart silo system and a Sanremo D8 Pro for cupping and quality control — the same equipment we use for our own range, we also make available to the brands we work alongside.</p>",
            "text_style": "body"
          }
        },
        "button": {
          "type": "button",
          "settings": {
            "button_label": "Co-roasting",
            "button_link": "/pages/co-roasting",
            "button_style_secondary": true
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": ["heading", "text", "button"]
    },
    "team": {
      "type": "cesar-team",
      "settings": {
        "caption": "",
